#   16,129,570 and 1,801,570 bytes. The standard IHDP benchmark file used by CFRNet,
#   CEVAE and Dragonnet: 747 units (672 + 75) x 100 replicates, 25 covariates, with the
#   simulated response surfaces mu0 and mu1. Recorded 2026-09-10.
